---
// Two jobs the business actually does: vet the factory, then land the pallet.
---

<section class="why band" id="quality">
  <div class="wrap">
  <header class="why__head">
    <h2 class="h2">Why RangeBallsDirect</h2>
    <span class="why__kicker">The right questions, at every stage</span>
  </header>

  <div class="why__grid">
    <article class="card card--feature">
      <p class="card__eyebrow card__eyebrow--accent">01 — Quality control</p>
      <h3 class="card__title">We know how a golf ball<br />gets cheaper</h3>
      <p class="card__subhead">And we've learned what makes it better.</p>
      <p class="card__body">
        Our approach is shaped by 30 years in professional golf and coaching, alongside a
        background in procurement. We have worked with our nominated factories to understand their
        material choices and quality checks.
      </p>
      <p class="card__body">
        A range using ball-tracking technology may value greater consistency. Another may need a
        dependable standard ball. Both can be quality choices; we select the factory and the ball
        to suit how your range operates.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card card--quiet">
      <p class="card__eyebrow">02 — Import &amp; delivery</p>
      <h3 class="card__title card__title--sm">Handled end to end</h3>
      <p class="card__body card__body--muted">
        Freight, customs and onward delivery across Europe — all managed by us. You place one
        order; we bring the balls to your range, ready for the tee line.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card card--pop">
      <div class="card__figure">Beyond the price and the price</div>
      <div class="card__caption">We look at materials, construction and factory checks before recommending a range ball.</div>
    </article>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why__head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .why__kicker {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .why__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .card { border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px; }

  .card--feature {
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 34px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card--quiet { background: var(--bone); border: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .card--pop {
    background: var(--pop);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card__eyebrow {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .card__eyebrow--accent { color: var(--pop); margin-bottom: 16px; }

  .card__title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 31px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.04;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .card__title--sm { font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.08; margin-bottom: 12px; }

  .card__subhead {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--pop);
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  .card__body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.62;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    max-width: 44ch;
  }

  .card__body--muted { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; max-width: none; }

  .card__figure {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 46px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--pop-text);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .card__caption { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.72); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .why__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    /* Without this the feature card keeps its two-row span and leaves a hole. */
    .card--feature { grid-row: auto; }
  }
</style>
